<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Thursday, slaughter steers and heifers were fully steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1125-1450 lbs 63.50-66.00, largely 64.00-65.50. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 62.00-63.75. Select 1-2 1050-1300 lbs 60.00-62.00, few returing to feedlot 1060-1170 lbs 63.80-64.80.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1050-1320 lbs 62.50-65.00.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 60.00-62.50.</p>
</text>
